    "regime_notes": "Positive IC in all calendar regimes: 2020-2022 IC 0.05437 (ICIR 0.15626, 612 dates); 2023-2024 IC 0.02119 (0.06345, 445 dates); 2025-2026 IC 0.02388 (0.07084, 417 dates); 2027-2028-08-14 IC 0.01745 (0.05668, 229 dates). Conditional activation reduces observation coverage because down-regime dates are intentionally inactive; interpret small cross-section uncertainty conservatively.",
